        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Complementing our vehicles, we provide a suite of value-added software and services which we expect to continue to generate long-term brand loyalty while also creating a recurring revenue stream across the vehicle lifecycle.",
        "start_character": 6453,
        "end_character": 6677
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001874178-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001874178-26-000008-06102744b9ac7ec6",
        "accession_number": "0001874178-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the vehicle service network, we work with partner collision centers and other repair and maintenance providers and supply them with the parts they need for work on Rivian vehicles.",
        "start_character": 8943,
        "end_character": 9138
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001874178-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001874178-26-000008-06102744b9ac7ec6",
        "accession_number": "0001874178-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we operate the Rivian Gear Shop offering customers a range of vehicle and non-vehicle accessories including our adventure gear.",
        "start_character": 10821,
        "end_character": 10961
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001874178-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001874178-26-000008-06102744b9ac7ec6",
        "accession_number": "0001874178-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The choices we make in the design phase of our products including decisions about material selection, form factor, manufacturability, durability, and serviceability have an impact on the overall environmental footprint.",
        "start_character": 29457,
        "end_character": 29676
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001874178-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001874178-26-000008-06102744b9ac7ec6",
        "accession_number": "0001874178-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also subject to permitting, registration, and other government approval requirements under environmental, health, and safety laws and regulations applicable in the jurisdictions in which we operate, obligating us to obtain permits, registrations, and other government approvals from one or more governmental agencies to conduct our operations and sell our products and services.",
        "start_character": 18527,
        "end_character": 18912
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001874178-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001874178-26-000008-06102744b9ac7ec6",
        "accession_number": "0001874178-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the primary competitive factors in our markets are talent and culture, technological innovation, product performance and quality, customer experience, brand differentiation, product design, pricing and TCO, and manufacturing scale and efficiency.",
        "start_character": 16494,
        "end_character": 16751
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001874178-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001874178-26-000008-06102744b9ac7ec6",
        "accession_number": "0001874178-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also announced plans to manufacture our midsize platform (“MSP”) which underpins the R2 and R3 product lines.",
        "start_character": 3023,
        "end_character": 3140
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001874178-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001874178-26-000008-06102744b9ac7ec6",
        "accession_number": "0001874178-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Rivian has dealer licenses in most of the states where we are permitted to operate, with plans to obtain licenses in additional states.",
        "start_character": 25111,
        "end_character": 25246
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001874178-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001874178-26-000008-06102744b9ac7ec6",
